// The Commons writer, draft 1 (non-story crew). For the head writer's review.
tpl: warm
talk: Bright and quick to say it'll all be fine, then a small worried "won't it?" on the end. Sings under her breath while she works and stops when she's noticed. Apologises for things that aren't her fault. Kind to everyone, especially anyone newer than her.
cares: the record cabinet's songs | getting the guitar right one day | the early team's breakfast going out on time | home
jokes: today is always the day she gets the chord right | she and Hamid practise guitar together, and it isn't helping either of them
hi: Hi! | Oh, hello! | Hey you
bye: See you soon! | Look after yourself | Bye for now
yes: Yes! Easy | Oh, definitely | I'd love to
thanks: Oh, thank you! | You're lovely
wow: Oh, look at that! | Brilliant
sigh: Oh, dear
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: cheer
openness: open
loves: music | sweet
likes: tea
invites: music
joy: singing along to the record cabinet
thread: homesick
keepsake: a song she wrote out for you, chords and all
avoid: being told she's always cheerful (she isn't, and it costs her)
